    title:
      "Educational Programs and Operations Levy Renewal - Northshore School",
    content:
      "Source URL: https://northcreek.nsd.org/fs/pages/1301\nCategory: academics\n\nEducational Programs and Operations Levy Renewal\nThe EP&O Levy renewal continues funding for the day-to-day operations of\nthe district. It helps increase opportunities for our students, bridging\nthe gap between the funding Northshore receives from the state and what\nwe need to fully support students, staff, and schools.\nview the EP&O Levy Renewal resolution\nExtracurricular activities like clubs, arts and music, and sports.\nStaffing above what the state funds, including paraeducators, nurses,\ncounselors, family engagement specialists, IT support and security\nstaff. Passage of the EP&O Levy renewal would also support some student\nclass size reductions.\nS\nupports advanced course work including International Baccalaureate,\nAdvanced Placement, College in the High School, etc.\nServices and programs to support students, including special education,\nEnglish learners, students experiencing homelessness, and transportation\nIf you have additional questions regarding the bond or levies, please\nemail\nbondlevy@nsd.org\n.",
