      'Source URL: https://northcreek.nsd.org/fs/pages/8839\nCategory: counseling\n\nSchool Supplies\n2026-27 School Supply List\n2026-27 CANYON PARK MIDDLE SCHOOL SUPPLY LIST\nIn an effort to ensure equitable access to school supplies, reduce the\namount of money and time parents spend purchasing items for school, and\npromote academic success for every student, the School Supply Advisory\nCommittee developed the following expectations:\nSchool supplies are requested but not required.\nTeachers may also request additional supplies for their individual\nclass(s).\nIf purchasing school supplies creates a financial hardship, please\ncontact our office manager\nKswanson@nsd.org\nand supplies will be provided.\nExceptions may be made for students served by special education\nprograms.\nWant to donate supplies? Visit the\nNorthshore Schools Foundation to learn more\n.\nGeneral Supplies for All Grades and All Students\n1” White binder\n8 Tab Divider for 3 ring binder\n1 Box of pencils and manual pencil sharpener\nColored pencils (1 set 12 colors)\nPens (2 blue or black and 2 red, non click)\nHighlighters - 1 Set chisel tip, 1 each pink, yellow, blue, green,\norange and purple\nPencil Pouch\nScissors\nRuler\n8 ½ x11 Graph Paper 1 pack\n1 pack Post-it-Notes\n1 Glue Stick\nCollege Ruled Lined Paper\nCorded headphones or corded earbuds (\nmust not\nbe wireless or Bluetooth enabled)\nOptional - Paper planner\nHealth & Fitness and PE Electives:\nUniform Requirement\nCanyon Park Knights gray crewneck t‑shirt (required; student’s name must\nbe written on it)\nBlue, black or gray shorts or sweatpants\nAthletic shoes\nPlease note: The gray Canyon Park Knights t‑shirt is a required part of\nthe uniform and must be purchased through the online store.\nStudents may bring shorts or athletic pants they already own or purchase\nelsewhere, as long as they meet the color guidelines above. If you need\nfinancial assistance with this purchase, please contact Ms. Swanson in\nthe main office.\nFamilies can purchase PE clothes from the vendor through 9/8/26.\nTo order from the On-line store\n6th Grade\n7th Grade\n8th Grade\nMath: 2 Spiral Notebooks\nSocial Studies: Composition Notebook\nEnglish: Composition Notebook\nScience: 0.75" 3 Ring Binder\nElectives: Teachers will hand out supply list specific to each class\nSocial Studies: Composition NoteBook\nScience: 1" 3 Ring Binder\nMath: 2 Notebooks (Spiral or Composition)\nScience: 1 Composition Graphing Notebook',
