      "Source URL: https://northcreek.nsd.org/fs/pages/6279\nCategory: activities\n\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nFernwood Elementary PTSA\nServing students, staff, and community at Fernwood Elementary School in\nNorthshore School District.\n3933 Jewell Road, Bothell, WA 98012\nMission\nThe Fernwood Elementary PTSA is committed to being a powerful voice as\nwe advocate for our children and their education while providing\nrelevant resources for families and promoting activities that enhance\nemotional or academic well-being of our students and staff in a way that\ncomplements and enriches their learning environment, while increasing\nour outreach to the community.\nPTSA Updates\nPurchase your Fernwood Elementary spirit wear\nPurchase Here\nEvery purchase helps fund PTSA programs and events\nGet Fernwood Gear\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated",
