      "Source URL: https://northcreek.nsd.org/fs/pages/11168\nCategory: calendar\n\nDevice Protection Plan For 2026-27\nThe new Device Protection Program for 26-27 starts on 9/1/26. -\nMore Info\nDistrict-Mandated Password Update\nWith the new password requirements, the district is asking all students\nto update their passwords to meet the new requirements and help keep\ntheir accounts secure.\nClick here for more information and instructions on changing your\npassword.\nBack to School Fall 2026\nWelcome Back, Ravens! ��\n��\nClick here for important back-to-school information and resources!\nPersonal Mobile Device Policy\nILHS is committed to ensuring an engaging, relevant, rigorous, and\ncollaborative learning experience for our students to grow and thrive.\nPlease review the new ILHS Mobile Device Policy.\nSep\n7\nLabor Day: No School\nall day\n9\nWednesday Early Release\n11\nRosh Hashanah\n14\nGanesh Chaturthi\n16\nFrontofSchoolNewSign.png\nimage011.jpg\nPXL_20241105_2005508765.jpg\n_Z72684412.jpg\nPXL_20250909_19534561711.jpg\n20241024_08443111.jpg\n_DSC0816.jpg\nIMG_0274111.png\nPT.png\nilhs-class-of-2023-2191.jpg\nospi31.png\nMain Office:\n425-408-6201\nSchedule\nDaily 8:10 a.m. - 3:00 p.m.\nWednesday Early Release: 1:30 p.m.\nRegistrar - Attendance\n425-408-6210\nILHSattendance@nsd.org\nAttendance Questions?\nRegistration Questions?\nFax\n425-408-6202\nCounseling Office\n425-408-6209\nHealth Room\n425-408-6206\nPrincipal\nTiffany Rodriguez\n425-408-6205\nOffice Manager\nKelly Duhamel\nFollow ILHS on social media!\nFULL CONTACT INFO",
