      "Source URL: https://northcreek.nsd.org/fs/pages/908\nCategory: calendar\n\nWays to help sas\nInfo Tour\nGRADUATION PAGE\nSAS NEWS\nSAFETY STUDY HALL : STATE - PROVIDED STUDENT SAFETY AND WELLNESS\nSUPPORTS\nStay connected to the SAS community and see what is happening at SAS\ntoday:\nFollow us on Instagram\n@secondaryacademyforsuccess\nCURRICULUM NIGHT 2026 -27\nThursday, October 1, 2026 – Starting at 6:30pm\nDistrict - Mandated Password Update\nWith the new password requirements, the district is asking all students\nto update their passwords to meet the new requirements and help keep\ntheir accounts secure.\nClick here for more information and instructions on changing your\npassword.\nDistrict Policy on Personal Mobile Devices 2025-26\nGuidelines for Appropriate Device Use at School\nSchoology Introduction Videos\nLearn a bit more about the Schoology system and how it can be used by\nparents and students.\nStudent Rights & Responsibilities Parent Letters\nLearn more about the rights & responsibilities of students in the\nNorthshore School District.\nSep\n7\nLabor Day: No School\nall day\n9\nWednesday Early Release\n11\nRosh Hashanah\n14\nGanesh Chaturthi\nMain Office Phone:\n425-408-6601\nAttendance Line:\n425-408-6610\nEmail:\nsasattendance@nsd.org\nPrincipal:\nBryan Stutz\nSchedule\nDaily 8:20 a.m. - 2:55 p.m.\nWednesday Early Release: 1:25 p.m.",
