    content:
      "Source URL: https://northcreek.nsd.org/fs/pages/7974\nCategory: family resources\n\nSchool District\n2018 Capital Bond Construction & Building Improvements\nThe new concert hall accommodates approximately 750 seats and adds\nclassroom and instruction space to Inglemoor High School.\nLearn More\nThe new K-5 elementary school is located on Maltby Road, close to Little\nBear Creek Road. The school serves approximately 500 students.\nThe Skyview and Canyon Creek multi-use building added 30 classrooms to\nthe campus.\nAll\n2018 Bond\n2022 Bond\nArrowhead\nBothell\nCanyon Creek\nCanyon Park\nCottage Lake\nCrystal Springs\nEast Ridge\nFernwood\nFrank Love\nHollywood Hill\nInglemoor\nInnovation Lab\nKenmore ES\nKenmore MS\nKokanee\nLeota\nLockwood\nMaywood Hills\nMoorlands\nNorth Creek\nNorthshore\nNorthshore Family Partnership\nNorthshore Networks\nRuby Bridges\nSAS\nShelton View\nSkyview\nSorenson\nSunrise\nTimbercrest\nWellington\nWesthill\nWoodin\nWoodinville\nWoodmoor\nPreparation for 8 School Construction Updates Makes Steady Progress\nNov\n7\n2022\nWoodmoor Elementary Playfield, Inclusive Playground, and Carpeting\nProjects Nearing Completion\nOct\n28\nProgress Continues on Camera Installations\nAug\n8\nField Improvements Launching Summer 2022\nJun\n17\nCritical Step Taken to Begin Planning 2022 Capital Bond Projects\nMar\n11\nSchools Receive Public Address/TCU System Upgrades Through Summer 2022\nFeb\n23\n2006 Bond\n2010 Bond\n2014 Bond\nRelated Bond Projects 2014\nRelated Bond Projects 2010\nBuilding Modernization Projects 2010\nBuilding Modernization Projects 2014\n2006 Bond Projects: Bothell H.S, Canyon Creek EL, Fernwood EL, Kenmore\nMS, SAS, Woodinville H.S\nPop Keeney and Other District Field Renovation\nKenmore Junior High Phase III\nWoodinville High School Phase II\nNorth Creek High School\nWoodinville High School Phase III\nInglemoor Concert Hall\nElementary School #21\nSkyview & Canyon Creek Expansion",
